 just as crucially, where not to: within the uninterrupted course of day-to-day routine. Casual/Tease lingers exactly where nothing seems to happen, within the casual continuity of everyday life: a quiet view from a window onto a flowering boulevard, a household ladder leaning within reach, a handmade ceramic vessel ready to hold a bouquet. Each work in Casual/Tease first appears as a small, innocent fragment of daily life, caught in a fleeting moment of ease. Look a little longer, however, and that ease begins to fracture. The window view borrows the gaze of a military drone…","people":[],"isFree":true,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://agendabrussels2.imgix.net/8829e863a3a892a75ece3a6376990d969cc5971a.jpg","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700024511","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true},{"id":"bxl-5700024362","title":"Tim Braden - 'Contre-jour'","category":"art","venueID":"v-e84e50882855","start":"2026-09-10T22:00:00Z","end":"2026-10-31T22:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"","people":[],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://agendabrussels2.imgix.net/d95f3851f9c06f7f300bc0e5f4a9b5fe3b1a426a.jpg","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700024362","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"fewLeft":null,"reviews":[],"selected":true},{"id":"bxl-5700024194","title":"Olga Tobreluts, Irina Annina, Dmitry Bulnygin - 'Notes from EDEN'","category":"art","venueID":"v-de55c003a0fc","start":"2026-09-10T22:00:00Z","end":"2026-11-14T22:59:00Z","openingNight":null,"summary":"","people":[],"isFree":false,"priceFrom":null,"imageURL":"https://agendabrussels2.imgix.net/7c21ad8ab3915f4db85d91d78e3271b42feeb37c.png","sourceURL":"https://visit.brussels/fr/visiteurs/agenda/event-detail.5700024194","sourceName":"agenda.brussels","isFestival":false,"showtimes":[],"soldOut":null,"f